tlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 Lily: 7. ________\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa30 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 Tom: 8. ________\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa30 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 Lily: What do pandas like?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 Tom: 9. ________\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sb40 \sa100 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs28 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af3 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \b1 \u19971?\u12289?\u-27131?\u-29701?\u29702?\u-30237?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi240 \u-248?\u19968?\u-247?\u-29701?\u30701?\u25991?\u-244?\u21028?\u26029?\u19979?\u21015?\u21477?\u23376?\u26159?\u21542?\u19982?\u30701?\u25991?\u20869?\u23481?\u30456?\u31526?\u-244?\u30456?\u31526?\u30340?\u20889?\u8220?T\u8221?\u-244?\u19981?\u30456?\u31526?\u30340?\u20889?\u8220?F\u8221?\u12290?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa100 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 My name is Peter. I am a boy. I am ten years old. I go to school from Monday to Friday. I like my school. My favourite subject is English. On Sunday, I go to the park with my father and mother. We fly kites and ride bikes. We are happy.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 1.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?Peter is a girl.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 2.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?Peter is ten years old.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 3.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?Peter goes to school from Monday to Friday.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 4.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?Peter\u8217?s favourite subject is Chinese.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 5.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?On Sunday, Peter goes to the park with his parents.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi240 \u-248?\u20108?\u-247?\u-29701?\u30701?\u25991?\u-244?\u-28663?\u25321?\u27491?\u30830?\u30340?\u31572?\u26696?\u-244?\u23558?\u23383?\u27597?\u32534?\u21495?\u20889?\u22312?\u25324?\u21495?\u20869?\u12290?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa100 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 Hello, I\u8217?m Alice. Today is Sunday. It is sunny and warm. I go to the zoo with my friends Ben and Lucy. We see many animals. Look at the elephants. They are big. The monkeys are funny. They like bananas. The pandas are fat. They like bamboo. We take photos. We have a good time.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa30 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 1.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?What day is it today?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 A. Saturday\u12288?\u12288?B. Sunday\u12288?\u12288?C. Friday\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa30 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 2.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?How is the weather today?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 A. Sunny and warm\u12288?\u12288?B. Rainy and cold\u12288?\u12288?C. Windy and cool\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa30 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 3.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?Alice goes to the ________ with her friends.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 A. park\u12288?\u12288?B. zoo\u12288?\u12288?C. school\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa30 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 4.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?The monkeys like ________.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 A. bamboo\u12288?\u12288?B. bananas\u12288?\u12288?C. apples\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa30 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 5.\u-248?\u12288?\u-247?Alice and her friends ________ at the zoo.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 A. take photos\u12288?\u12288?B. fly kites\u12288?\u12288?C. ride bikes\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi240 \u-248?\u19977?\u-247?\u-29701?\u30701?\u25991?\u-244?\u29992?\u-32015?\u25991?\u22238?\u31572?\u19979?\u21015?\u-27154?\u-26472?\u12290?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa100 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 I am Kitty. I get up at six thirty in the morning. I have breakfast at seven. I go to school at seven thirty. In the afternoon, I do my homework at home. In the evening, I read books. I go to bed at nine.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 1. When does Kitty get up?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 2. When does Kitty have breakfast?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 3. What does Kitty do in the afternoon?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 4. What does Kitty do in the evening?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi480 5. When does Kitty go to bed?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sb40 \sa100 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs28 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af3 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \b1 \u20843?\u12289?\u20070?\u-26782?\u-30616?\u-28738?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi240 \u29992?3\u8212?5\u21477?\u-29731?\u20171?\u32461?\u20320?\u30340?\u19968?\u20301?\u23478?\u20154?\u-248?\u29240?\u29240?\u12289?\u22920?\u22920?\u12289?\u29239?\u29239?\u25110?\u22902?\u22902?\u31561?\u-247?\u12290?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi240 \u25552?\u31034?\u-29747?\u-230?tall / short / fat / thin\u-244?doctor / teacher / worker\u-244?like\u-244?can\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl360 \slmult1 \fs24 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af1 \hich \af1 \loch \af1 \fi240 \u21442?\u-32765?\u21477?\u22411?\u-230?This is my... He/She is... He/She likes... He/She can...\par \pard \plain \qc \li0 \ri0 \sb20 \sa120 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs28 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af3 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \b1 \page \u21442?\u-32765?\u31572?\u26696?\u-248?\u20379?\u25945?\u24072?\u26680?\u23545?\u-247?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u19968?\u12289?\u23383?\u27597?\u19982?\u20070?\u20889?\u-230?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?1.\u-248?1\u-247?a c\u12288?\u-248?2\u-247?e g\u12288?\u-248?3\u-247?l n\u12288?\u-248?4\u-247?r t\u12288?\u-248?5\u-247?w y\u-248?\u22823?\u23567?\u20889?\u22343?\u21487?\u-247?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?2. apple\u8212?1\u-244?bird\u8212?2\u-244?cat\u8212?3\u-244?dog\u8212?4\u-244?egg\u8212?5\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u20108?\u12289?\u-29747?\u27719?\u-230?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?A. 1. C\u12288?2. D\u12288?3. C\u12288?4. C\u12288?5. D\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?B. 1. \u31062?\u29238?\u-248?\u29239?\u29239?/\u22806?\u20844?\u-247?\u12288?2. \u26089?\u-26352?\u12288?3. \u-26904?\u20254?\u12288?4. \u25805?\u22330?\u12288?5. \u21475?\u28212?\u30340?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?C. 1. panda\u12288?2. elephant\u12288?3. noodles\u12288?4. sweater\u12288?5. Monday\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?D. 1. read\u12288?2. feet\u12288?3. hungry\u12288?4. kite\u12288?5. autumn\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u19977?\u12289?\u21333?\u-26503?\u-28663?\u25321?\u-230?1. A\u12288?2. B\u12288?3. A\u12288?4. B\u12288?5. B\u12288?6. A\u12288?7. B\u12288?8. C\u12288?9. B\u12288?10. B\u12288?11. A\u12288?12. A\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u22235?\u12289?\u24773?\u26223?\u20132?\u-27067?\u-230?1. C\u12288?2. A\u12288?3. B\u12288?4. E\u12288?5. D\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u20116?\u12289?\u-28706?\u-29747?\u25104?\u21477?\u-230?1. What is it?\u12288?2. I like apples.\u12288?3. How are you?\u12288?4. This is a dog.\u12288?5. I can swim.\u12288?6. This is my new friend.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u20845?\u12289?\u-30619?\u20840?\u23545?\u-29731?\u-230?1. C\u12288?2. D\u12288?3. B\u12288?4. A\u12288?5. E\u12288?6. C\u12288?7. A\u12288?8. B\u12288?9. D\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u19971?\u12289?\u-27131?\u-29701?\u29702?\u-30237?\u-230?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u-248?\u19968?\u-247?1. F\u12288?2. T\u12288?3. T\u12288?4. F\u12288?5. T\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u-248?\u20108?\u-247?1. B\u12288?2. A\u12288?3. B\u12288?4. B\u12288?5. A\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u-248?\u19977?\u-247?1. At six thirty. / She gets up at six thirty.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u12288?\u12288?2. At seven. / She has breakfast at seven.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u12288?\u12288?3. She does her homework (at home).\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u12288?\u12288?4. She reads books.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u12288?\u12288?5. At nine. / She goes to bed at nine.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u20843?\u12289?\u20070?\u-26782?\u-30616?\u-28738?\u-248?\u21442?\u-32765?\u31572?\u26696?\u-244?\u20379?\u21442?\u-32765?\u-247?\u-230?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?This is my father. He is a doctor. He is tall. He likes reading. He can swim.\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u12288?\u12288?\u-248?\u-29715?\u21477?\u-28646?\u-26502?\u12289?\u20869?\u23481?\u23436?\u25972?\u12289?\u-29715?\u27861?\u27491?\u30830?\u21363?\u21487?\u-244?\u19981?\u24517?\u19982?\u21442?\u-32765?\u31572?\u26696?\u19968?\u-32268?\u12290?\u-247?\par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \par \pard \plain \ql \li0 \ri0 \sa50 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \sl320 \slmult1 \fs22 \kerning2 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \u27880?\u-230?\u26412?\u21367?\u20026?\u-29750?\u26029?\u24615?\u32451?\u20064?\u-244?\u19981?\u-27056?\u23450?\u26102?\u-27148?\u12289?\u19981?\u-29776?\u20998?\u-244?\u30446?\u30340?\u22312?\u20110?\u24110?\u21161?\u23401?\u23376?\u21457?\u29616?\u-31356?\u24369?\u29615?\u-32126?\u12290?\u24314?\u-29778?\u23436?\u25104?\u21518?\u19982?\u23401?\u23376?\u19968?\u-29321?\u26680?\u23545?\u31572?\u26696?\u-244?\u-27512?\u23545?\u-27367?\u-26472?\u-28709?\u-30644?\u22797?\u20064?\u24041?\u22266?\u12290?\u21548?\u21147?\u-28440?\u20998?\u30053?\u12290?\par }